	(text "1. Servos run on 5 V from U3 (UBEC). Never power servos from the Nano 5V pin.\n2. ESC red BEC wires (BEC_5V) stay unconnected and taped off.\n3. All grounds are common (every GND symbol is the same net).\n4. Swap any two motor wires (A/B/C) to reverse a motor.\n5. Check the UBEC gives 5 V with a meter before plugging in servos.\n6. Connect the battery last, through S1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
